# inc-bsqm reproduction: read the over-cap miss in Creature::GainInherentBonus.
#
# An orc barbarian's 1st-level EV_ADVANCE calls
# GainInherentBonus(A_STR,1d2,false) (lib/classes.irh:216) before any tome, so
# the session needs no equipment at all. With INCURSION_INH_PROBE=1 the probe
# above GainInherentBonus (src/Creature.cpp) fills that attribute to its cap
# and adds the shambling mound's uncapped ADJUST_INH grant (lib/mon3.irh:2102)
# just before the call, then writes the result to logs/inh.log.
#
# The walk is only there so tools/headless.sh sees a completed turn and does
# not report the run as vacuous; the probe fires during character generation.
@include chargen.keys

DOWN*4 RIGHT*4 UP*4 LEFT*4
.*5
@dump:probed
@quit
